#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xb_showroom_wall_self_order.field_pos_config__xb_showroom_screen_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:xb_showroom_wall_self_order.field_res_config_settings__pos_xb_showroom_screen_id
msgid ""
"The kiosk's product page gets a button that shows the piece on this wall. "
"Only products ticked 'Show on the showroom wall'."
